 "remarks": "Welcome to Woodside Green - Centrally located pet friendly complex attractive for its proximity to Stamford's Metro North, Downtown shops and restaurants, Ridgeway Shopping Plaza, Scalzi Park and Health Clubs...with an easy access to I-95 and Merritt Pkwy, this unit is ideal for commuters. Welcome to this bright and inviting charming first-floor studio, ideally located in a vibrant and walkable neighborhood. It features a spacious, well-apportioned living room with oversized windows and two good size closets, cozy and very functional fully equipped kitchen with granite countertop, newer appliances and a great size pantry as well as spacious updated bathroom with shower/tub combo and a large window for proper ventilation that has also been upgraded. The A/C/heating unit is only 3 yrs old. Additional highlights: One off-street parking space, common laundry in the basement. Monthly HOA includes cooking gas, hot water, cold water and sewer. Investors are welcome! Schedule your tour today and see what makes this unit so special!",
